      "h1": "Clay from the Ganga. <em>Three generations</em> of hands.",
      "lede": "We make Durga, Saraswati, Kali and Lakshmi pratimas for family pujos, club pandals and Bengali associations abroad. Every idol starts as bamboo and straw in this lane, and leaves with her eyes painted by the same family that painted your grandfather's.",
