            "p2": "The traditional single-frame set for barir pujo. Classic Bengali face, sholar saaj, delivered to your thakur dalan by Panchami.",
            "b": "From ₹38,000",
            "span": "book by June"
          },
          {
            "photo": {
              "src": "/demo/idol-maker/images/unfinished-durga.jpg",
